msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na edobere na Dị Mfe, enwere ike ịmepụta Eserese na Isi Iyi Data naanị site na Eserese Ọhụrụ. Ọ bụrụ na Ọkaibe, a na-akwado mmepụta Eserese na Isi Iyi Data ochie."

#: include/global_settings.php:444
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Dị Mfe"

#: include/global_settings.php:445 lib/html.php:2948
