msgstr "Boost ọ ga-akwado mmelite RRD mgbe achọrọ na Cacti? Ọ bụrụ na ị gbanyụọ ya, mgbanwe a agaghị arụ ọrụ ruo mgbe oge polling na-esote gasịrị. Mgbe ị nwere Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya, a chọrọ ka agbanwuo ntọala a."

#: include/global_settings.php:2079
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Onye Mmelite RRD Ọkwa Sistemụ"

#: include/global_settings.php:2080
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Tupu Enwee Ike Ihichapụ Mmelite RRD Mgbe Achọrọ Ya, ọsọ poller ga-agafe mgbe niile"

#: include/global_settings.php:2085
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Ugboro Ole Boost Kwesịrị Imelite RRD Niile"

#: include/global_settings.php:2086
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Mgbe ị gbanwuola boost, a na-emelite faịlụ RRD gị naanị mgbe onye ọrụ rịọrọ ha, ma ọ bụ mgbe oge a gafere."

