#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>NKỌWA:</strong> Ị banyere na Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya. Mgbe ọ dị <b>'n'ịntanetị'</b>, ị ga-enwe ike ilele ma jikwaa ọtụtụ n'ime Weebụsaịtị Isi Cacti dị ka a ga-asị na ị banyere na ya. Ọzọkwa, ọ dị mkpa ịmara na Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya kwesịrị iji njirimara <b>'Mmelite Mgbe Achọrọ Ya'</b> nke Ọrụ Nwelite Arụmọrụ Cacti, anyị na-akwadokwa iji Spine mgbe niile. Mgbe Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya <b>'anọghị n'ịntanetị'</b>, Weebụsaịtị Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya ga-enwe obere ozi. Otú ọ dị, ọ ga-echekwa mmelite niile nwa oge ruo mgbe enwere ike iru Nchekwa Data Isi Cacti na Sava Web. Mgbe ahụ ọ ga-ebuga nsonaazụ tebụl Boost ya laghachi na Nchekwa Data Isi Cacti maka mmelite."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>NKỌWA:</strong> Ọ dịghị nke ọ bụla n'ime Plọgin Isi Cacti, ruo taa, ka emegharịrị ka ọ rụọ ọrụ na Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya. Ya mere, Plọgin ndị dị ka MacTrack, na HMIB, nke chọrọ ohere ozugbo na ngwaọrụ agaghị arụ ọrụ na Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya n'oge a. Otú ọ dị, plọgin ndị dị ka Thold ga-arụ ọrụ ma ọ bụrụhaala na Ngwa Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya dị n'ọnọdụ <b>'n'ịntanetị'</b>."

